    {
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "sourceBlockId": "block_26",
      "sourceUnitId": null,
      "sourceText": "For 1 SP , the Re-Equip Action lets an Adventurer equip Items from, and Store Items into, their Pack. Adventurers may also take Items and Companions from adjacent Adventurers. However, Adventurers may never give Items or Companions to another Adventurer. The Adventurer being taken from may also Re-Equip their Items during this Action, but may not take Items or Companions from another Adventurer.",
